OL,3,GNEWSA'Love of reading' key to improving
OL,4,Acity's literacy rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Peterborough headteacher says
OL,7,Fallowing children to choose what they
OL,8,Fwant to read is an important part of
OL,9,Fimproving literacy rates.
OL,11,FSt Augustine's Junior School have been
OL,12,Fpromoting a love of reading in their
OL,13,Fchildren, with lessons including making
OL,14,Fbook covers, writing graffiti walls and
OL,15,Frecording book reviews on tablet
OL,16,Fdevices.
OL,18,FPeterborough has previously scored
OL,19,Fbelow the national average for English
OL,20,Frates.
