OL,3,GNEWSA'Love of reading' key to improving
OL,4,Acity's literacy rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2026, 77% of children at St
OL,7,FAugustine's achieved the expected
OL,8,Freading rate, above the national
OL,9,Faverage of 75%.
